From 5adf0114d298d92292feba1d839677d299b47b55 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 05:15:01 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(3d): refuse pocket depths beyond tool assembly reach

Refuse upright 3D Pocket jobs before path generation when a wider shank
or holder cannot remain above the material at Bottom Z. Name the tool,
band and depth remedy. Keep the verification laws unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #1844
